<title>USA: NY bank discount window borrowings nil Dec 4 week.</title>
<headline>NY bank discount window borrowings nil Dec 4 week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The six major New York City banks did not borrow from the Federal Reserve's discount window, a Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>It was the end of the two-week bank maintenance period.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
